="display:inline-block;padding:14px 28px;color:#ffffff;text-decoration:none;border-radius:10px;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Roboto,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:15px;font-weight:600">Pay online</a></td></tr></table><table role="presentation" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" style="margin:28px 0"><tr><td style="border-radius:10px;background-color:#161551"><a href="https://app.studafy.test/portal/license/invoices/i-1" style="display:inline-block;padding:14px 28px;color:#ffffff;text-decoration:none;border-radius:10px;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Roboto,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:15px;font-weight:600">View the invoice</a></td></tr></table><p style="color:#6b7480;font-size:12px">You receive this email because you manage your school&#39;s Studafy licence.</p></div></td></tr></table><table role="presentation" width="100%" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" style="max-width:560px"><tr><td style="padding:20px 32px;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Roboto,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:12px;line-height:1.6;color:#8a91a3;text-align:center">Sent by Studafy on behalf of Amman Academy.<br>&copy; Studafy. All rights reserved.</td></tr></table></td></tr></table>",
  "subject": "Payment overdue: invoice LIC-2026-000042 for Amman Academy's Studafy licence",
  "text": 
"Payment 2 of 12 on invoice LIC-2026-000042 was due on 1 November 2026, and 250.00 USD is still unpaid.
If it is still unpaid on 1 December 2026, Studafy AI stops for every seat on the licence until it is paid.
Licence: Amman Academy, 1 October 2026 to 1 October 2027.

How to pay:
Bank transfer to Studafy FZ-LLC, Arab Bank
IBAN: JO94CBJO0010000000000131000302
SWIFT/BIC: ARABJOAX
Currency: USD
Write the payment reference STF-AB12-CD34 on the transfer, then upload the receipt on the invoice page.
Or pay online: https://checkout.revolut.com/pay/abc

View the invoice: https://app.studafy.test/portal/license/invoices/i-1

You receive this email because you manage your school's Studafy licence."
,
}
`;

